      "body_plain": "Hi there,\n\nFirst of all, as an R addict and an India lover, I'm really happy to see that an R group exists in Bangalore !!\n\nI'm a post-doc fellow in the Ecology lab at the French Institute of Pondicherry where we are wondering about the opportunity to find somebody for a (1:4) x 1 week session of statistics formation (let's say from the very basics to GLM) combined with R introduction. Typically the format of Crawley's R Book would be perfect ! Naturally, we will fund that and provide all facilities if we find the right person ;)\n\nDo you guys have an idea where to find this absolute gem? Maybe in the Bangalore's RUG itself? Elsewhere?\nFeel free to contact me if you are interested and of course, spread the world more specifically or to others mail-lists that I may not know.\n\nThanks a lot for your help!\nAll the best,\n\nV.\n\n--\nDepartment of Ecology\nFrench Institute of Pondicherry, India\nwww.ifpindia.org <http://www.ifpindia.org>",
