      ],
      "body_plain": "21st Feb, 2012,\nDear Vincent,\nI hope you found some one to for a statistics and R session.\nIf not you can contact me.\nwe will see how we can manage this.\nvinay\n\nOn Feb 18, 12:16 pm, vinit.kaus...@gmail.com wrote:\n> Vincent, great to connect with you, Puducherry, and France. What a BRU! :-)\n>\n> Ecology ... I'm see its relevance in:\n> - disappearing rats from paddy fields of Godavari districts.\n> - unlocking the flow of wealth in tangled roots of real estate at Vajrahally region.\n>\n> Srini, are you listening to this ... Udupi style? :-)\n>\n> Regards,\n> Vinit at Bengaluru\n>\n> Sent from BlackBerry® on Airtel\n>\n\n> -----Original Message-----\n> From: Vincent Bonhomme <vincent.bonho...@ifpindia.org>\n>\n> Sender: bru...@googlegroups.com\n> Date: Fri, 17 Feb 2012 18:38:08\n\n> To: <bru...@googlegroups.com>\n> Reply-To: bru...@googlegroups.com\n\n> Subject: Looking for a statistics using R teacher\n>\n> Hi there,\n>\n> First of all, as an R addict and an India lover, I'm really happy to see\n> that an R group exists in Bangalore !!\n>\n> I'm a post-doc fellow in the Ecology lab at the French Institute of\n> Pondicherry where we are wondering about the opportunity to find somebody\n> for a (1:4) x 1 week session of statistics formation (let's say from the\n> very basics to GLM) combined with R introduction. Typically the format of\n> Crawley's R Book would be perfect ! Naturally, we will fund that and\n> provide all facilities if we find the right person ;)\n>\n> Do you guys have an idea where to find this absolute gem? Maybe in the\n> Bangalore's RUG itself? Elsewhere?\n> Feel free to contact me if you are interested and of course, spread the\n> world more specifically or to others mail-lists that I may not know.\n>\n> Thanks a lot for your help!\n> All the best,\n>\n> V.\n>\n> --\n> Department of Ecology\n> French Institute of Pondicherry, Indiawww.ifpindia.org <http://Indiawww.ifpindia.org>\n>\n>",
      "body_snippet": "21st Feb, 2012,\nDear Vincent,\nI hope you found some one to for a statistics and R session.\nIf not you can contact me.\nwe will see how we can manage this.\nvinay\n\nOn Feb 18, 12:16 pm, vinit.kaus...@gmai",
